# Iteration scratch kept at repo root: screenshots taken during
# thesis demos, draft chapter docs (.docx / .pdf / .txt), backup
# archives, verification notes. The leading slash anchors each
# pattern to the repo root, so the same extension under src/,
# public/, prisma/, docs/, etc. is NOT affected — a legitimate
# in-source .png asset or seeded SQL dump can still be tracked.
/*.png
/*.docx
/*.tar.gz
/thesis_ch*.pdf
/thesis_ch*.txt
/copy_thesis_*.txt
/batchread*.pdf
/batchread*.txt
/verifynotes.pdf


